WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.317 --> 00:00:02.900
(upbeat music)

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:05.945
- [Narrator] If you're like most people,

00:00:05.945 --> 00:00:07.680
you've probably felt like
our political climate

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.450
is hostile to freethinkers,
those who don't

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.770
automatically accept the
woke opinion of the day.

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.840
As someone who has gone
from woke to awake,

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.490
I'm here to tell you that it
hasn't always been this way.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:24.240
In fact, the guiding philosophy
of the U.S. Constitution

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.960
is Classical Liberalism,
but most people have

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.210
no idea what it truly means.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.373
It's time to fix that.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.640
Classical Liberalism posits
that the government's

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:36.400
top priority is protecting
individual rights,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.510
including the right to own what we earn

00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:41.210
and express what we
believe, so that society

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:44.960
can progress towards
tolerance and justice for all.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.640
Freedom and liberty are
of the highest order,

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.020
and the light touch of
government is allowed

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:51.700
when absolutely necessary.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.940
As you've likely noticed,
today's liberals have strayed

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:56.240
from this ideal.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:59.590
Modern Progressives take
pride in segregating Americans

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:03.540
into identity groups, like
Black, White, Gay or Straight,

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:07.450
abandoning the profoundly
simple, yet incredibly important

00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.460
idea that all men are created equal.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:13.850
The Progressive worldview is
tempting, because it's safe.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:16.890
As long as you accept your
privilege or your victimhood

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:20.610
status, you are guaranteed
social acceptance.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:23.800
This outlook squashes voices
who challenge the norm

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:27.450
and prevents us from achieving
the truly liberal goals

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.840
our founders imagined.

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:31.237
Free thinking is risky,
there isn't a road map that

00:01:31.237 --> 00:01:34.740
delivers you to a set destination,
and there's no political

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.860
party or identity group
for you to call home.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.320
But I would say that
charting your own course

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:42.570
is a risk worth taking.

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:45.063
Think for yourself, and thank me later.

